<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457">Please complete the attached copy of Letter of Authority with your Agent/Broker/Driver </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457">&nbsp; </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457"><b><span style="font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-language:EN-AU">Please note, NOA is sent on courtesy basis and as a regular customer we expect you to monitor your “imports and collections” list via our website </span></b></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457">&nbsp; </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457">&nbsp; </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457"><b><u>ADHOC PCA </u></b></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a href="https://freight.qantas.com/new-to-freight/payment-and-collection-delegation.html"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457">https://freight.qantas.com/new-to-freight/payment-and-collection-delegation.html</span></a><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457"> </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457">&nbsp; </span></p>

