EN-AU"> </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;
tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;
color:#323232;mso-fareast-language:EN-AU"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">3.<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span> <span style="font-size:14.0pt"><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp;</span>Requested MAWB will appear on you “Import and collections “list, select AWB and “generate collection ID”. Then the system will generate a 6 digits code. This code must be given to your driver as the authority to collect this shipment</span></span><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#323232;mso-fareast-language:
EN-AU"> </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457">&nbsp; </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457">&nbsp; </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
color:#44546A">We have received the above AirFreight and requires collection from imported warehouse from Qantas Freight</span></span><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;line-height:
107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1F497D"> in Sydney.</span> </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457">&nbsp; </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
color:#44546A">Qantas Freight offers and airport to airport service only and any goods or effects must be customs cleared and collected from our freight terminal at the final destination. </span> </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457">&nbsp; </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
color:#44546A">Clearing and collecting goods as an individual can be a complex process and we would advise the best way to proceed is to engage a customs clearing agent to clear the goods on your behalf. Some agents can also arrange collection and delivery of your goods to a nominated address. </span> </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457">&nbsp; </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
color:#44546A">Please note that Qantas Freight cannot arrange the clearance of your goods and we are not able to recommend any particular company but you will find many on any internet search engine and you should compare several quotes as prices and services may vary between companies. </span> </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457">&nbsp; </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457"><a name="_Hlk40514585"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#44546A">In some cases you may be permitted to arrange a clearance yourself with Australian Customs directly. You may find more information on that by contacting Customs on 1300 558 099 or at the following link… </span></a></span><a href="https://www.border.gov.au/Trav/Impo"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514585"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">https://www.border.gov.au/Trav/Impo</span></span></span></a><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514585"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
color:#44546A;mso-fareast-language:EN-AU"> </span> </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514457"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514585">&nbsp; </span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514585"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
color:#44546A;mso-fareast-language:EN-AU">To clear the goods yourself you may be required to collect the original documents at the freight terminal at the final destination and you will need 100 points of identification before we are able to release documents to you. Clearing goods yourself can only take place during Australian Customs operating hours which are generally between 9am and 4pm weekdays. </span> </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514585">&nbsp; </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514585"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
color:#44546A;mso-fareast-language:EN-AU">Once the goods are cleared you can then return to the Qantas Freight Terminal to pay any outstanding import handling fees and collect the goods. Payment can be made by cash or EFTPOS only.</span> </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_Hlk40514470"> &nbsp; </a></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514470"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
color:#44546A;mso-fareast-language:EN-AU">For the addresses of Qantas Freight’s International Freight Terminals </span></span><a href="http://www.qantas.com.au/cargo/pdf/QantasFreightTerminals_INTAUST.pdf"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514470"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;line-height:
107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Click Here</span></span></a><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514470"> </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514470"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
color:#44546A;mso-fareast-language:EN-AU">To access our schedule of handling fees and charges </span></span><a href="http://www.qantas.com.au/cargo/pdf/aust-terminal-service-fees_0104.pdf"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514470"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;line-height:
107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Click Here</span></span></a><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514470"> </span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk40514470">&nbsp; </span></p>

